LEAP Copyright & License Template
=================================

This file contains the standardized copyright and license boilerplate for the
LEAP codebase. Copy and paste the appropriate block below into the header of
every new or updated source file to protect IP and ensure consistency before
the public release.

Note: The "Author: F. Andy Seidl (https://www.linkedin.com/in/faseidl/)" line
used in the templates below is an EXAMPLE. When adding a header to a file, the
Author field should name the actual author/contributor of that file.

